1
00:00:03,306 --> 00:00:08,186
<font color="white">你們就在此被擊潰吧</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,774
<font color="white">唯有那麼做才能解放地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:12,858 --> 00:00:15,944
<font color="white">使他們擺脫被強加在身上的正義</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:17,362 --> 00:00:19,781
<font color="white">那麼，我們開始吧</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:43,472
<font color="white">我想戰鬥的對象</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:44,347 --> 00:00:46,224
<font color="white">就只有你一個人</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:46,308 --> 00:00:48,018
<font color="white">誰管那種事啊…</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:50,145 --> 00:00:54,191
<font color="white">就那點速度是無法抓住我的</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:02,491 --> 00:01:04,159
<font color="white">進次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:04,242 --> 00:01:08,413
<font color="white">伊多先生打算讓進次郎成為光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:08,497 --> 00:01:09,664
<font color="white">若是讓他得逞…</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:09,748 --> 00:01:14,544
<font color="white">喂，現在可無法從容地擔心那些了</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:15,212 --> 00:01:19,049
<font color="white">是要我們對付這傢伙是吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:25,388 --> 00:01:28,099
<font color="white">請放心，我會負責保護大家</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:28,183 --> 00:01:29,601
<font color="white">真可靠啊</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:01:29,684 --> 00:01:31,561
<font color="white">我們專心對付那個大塊頭吧</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:31,645 --> 00:01:32,938
<font color="white">-要上了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:11,369 --> 00:03:16,416
<font color="white">為了與你一戰，我特地準備這個擂台</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:18,501 --> 00:03:22,839
<font color="white">才能讓各位地球人也好好欣賞</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:28,053 --> 00:03:29,471
<font color="white">進次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:37,646 --> 00:03:40,190
<font color="white">你應該不只這點能力而已</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:40,273 --> 00:03:44,486
<font color="white">看你之所以不願使出真正的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:44,986 --> 00:03:50,408
<font color="white">是因為你果然害怕</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">成為光之巨人對吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:55,622 --> 00:03:59,417
<font color="white">我對你抱持的宿命深感同情</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:04:00,293 --> 00:04:04,339
<font color="white">但你卻把為保護地球而戰</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:04,422 --> 00:04:09,761
<font color="white">和改變自我的恐懼放在天秤上衡量</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:13,348 --> 00:04:17,102
<font color="white">將你所有的力量都展現出來吧</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:17,185 --> 00:04:20,105
<font color="white">光是打敗這個狀態的你</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:20,188 --> 00:04:23,733
<font color="white">根本無法解除人類身上的詛咒</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:39,624 --> 00:04:41,251
<font color="white">北斗！</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:54,973 --> 00:04:56,474
{\an8}<font color="white">大家…</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:05:09,029 --> 00:05:10,697
<font color="white">我能感覺到</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:16,119
<font color="white">真正的光之巨人快要在你體內誕生了</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:05:20,498 --> 00:05:21,458
<font color="white">解除限制器！</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:05:21,541 --> 00:05:24,336
<font color="white">能量再次攀升，已超越負荷限制值了</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:05:24,419 --> 00:05:25,754
<font color="white">還能撐多久？</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:05:25,837 --> 00:05:28,006
<font color="white">大概三分鐘，若是超過那時間…</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:05:29,424 --> 00:05:30,759
<font color="white">我不確定會有何後果</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:31,342 --> 00:05:34,846
<font color="white">莫非他真的會變成光之巨人？</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:34,929 --> 00:05:37,766
<font color="white">井手先生，積頓開始展開猛攻</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:37,849 --> 00:05:39,934
<font color="white">科學特搜隊也出現損害</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:41,102 --> 00:05:43,772
<font color="white">星山、五條</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:43,855 --> 00:05:46,191
<font color="white">這裡交給你們了</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:46,274 --> 00:05:48,068
<font color="white">-遵命</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-遵命</font></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:48,151 --> 00:05:49,652
<font color="white">萬事拜託了</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:50,987 --> 00:05:52,363
<font color="white">井手先生…</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:55,366 --> 00:05:58,244
<font color="white">貝姆拉，你這是打算做什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:58,828 --> 00:06:03,833
<font color="white">這一切都是我的行動所招致的結果</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:06:03,917 --> 00:06:05,752
<font color="white">因此…</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:06:05,835 --> 00:06:08,713
<font color="white">住手！你的身體已經…</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:06:09,339 --> 00:06:11,549
<font color="white">我要用盡最後一絲力量</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:11,633 --> 00:06:13,134
<font color="white">將你們…</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:13,218 --> 00:06:15,011
<font color="white">為什麼要這麼做？</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:15,512 --> 00:06:21,476
<font color="white">因為我無可救藥地喜歡上地球人了</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:27,982 --> 00:06:29,859
<font color="white">貝姆拉…</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:34,781 --> 00:06:35,824
<font color="white">那傢伙…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:35,907 --> 00:06:38,451
<font color="white">力量是不是比剛才更強了？</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:39,327 --> 00:06:40,411
<font color="white">那道光…</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:40,495 --> 00:06:43,289
<font color="white">看來那邊的狀況也同樣不樂觀啊</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:43,373 --> 00:06:44,624
<font color="white">不</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:45,542 --> 00:06:47,293
<font color="white">那小子沒問題</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:47,377 --> 00:06:50,463
<font color="white">我們只要專心打敗眼前的敵人就好</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:50,547 --> 00:06:52,465
<font color="white">只好再用一次那招</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:52,549 --> 00:06:55,009
<font color="white">太郎先生，你不要急著送死</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:57,095
<font color="white">可是已經沒有其他辦法了</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:57,178 --> 00:06:59,973
<font color="white">不對，還有一個辦法</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:07:00,056 --> 00:07:01,683
<font color="white">井手先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:04,769 --> 00:07:06,396
<font color="white">讓你久等了</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:07,897 --> 00:07:08,982
<font color="white">這個給你</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:09,065 --> 00:07:10,233
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:10,316 --> 00:07:12,819
<font color="white">雖然不敢保證能像過去那樣奏效</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:12,902 --> 00:07:14,696
<font color="white">總之只能奮力一搏了</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:14,779 --> 00:07:15,947
<font color="white">井手先生，積頓正要…</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:16,865
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:23,538 --> 00:07:27,125
<font color="white">看來我趕上了</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:27,208 --> 00:07:29,711
<font color="white">早田，你…</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:29,794 --> 00:07:30,712
<font color="white">快走吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:38,595 --> 00:07:40,680
<font color="white">-我們也前去掩護</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-明白！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:45,518 --> 00:07:47,687
<font color="white">早田先生？別亂來啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:47,770 --> 00:07:52,525
<font color="white">面對有淵源的宿敵</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我無法袖手旁觀，就這麼結束</font></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:08:15,298 --> 00:08:16,883
<font color="white">嵐，就是現在！</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:08:16,966 --> 00:08:18,134
<font color="white">（鎖定目標）</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:08:18,218 --> 00:08:19,802
<font color="white">好！</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:26,267 --> 00:08:27,685
<font color="white">他成功了</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:27,769 --> 00:08:29,979
<font color="white">-趁現在這機會</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:08:32,357 --> 00:08:35,485
<font color="white">剩下的就拜託你們了</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:36,945 --> 00:08:38,696
<font color="white">一口氣收拾敵人</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:40,156
<font color="white">-好！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-收到！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,074
<font color="white">明白！</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:49,541 --> 00:08:51,793
<font color="white">把你斬成碎塊！</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:52,877 --> 00:08:55,588
<font color="white">天啊，他們把積頓逼入絕境了！</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:55,672 --> 00:08:56,965
<font color="white">加油啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:57,048 --> 00:08:58,091
<font color="white">還沒結束呢！</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:09:03,555 --> 00:09:04,847
<font color="white">成功了！</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:09:04,931 --> 00:09:07,308
<font color="white">不，還沒結束，只能由我上了</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:09:07,392 --> 00:09:08,434
<font color="white">幫我一把</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:09:08,518 --> 00:09:09,519
<font color="white">太郎先生！</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:14,232 --> 00:09:16,526
<font color="white">就是現在，展開防護罩！</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:37,213 --> 00:09:38,172
<font color="white">積頓…</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:09:39,465 --> 00:09:40,466
<font color="white">太郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,593
<font color="white">你沒事吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:44,762 --> 00:09:46,306
<font color="white">我們做到了！</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:46,389 --> 00:09:47,974
<font color="white">進次郎呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:10:06,492 --> 00:10:12,248
<font color="white">這確實是光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:10:12,749 --> 00:10:17,253
<font color="white">不過我之所以存在</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:10:17,337 --> 00:10:20,632
<font color="white">就是為了擊潰那股力量</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:10:46,616 --> 00:10:49,869
<font color="white">到此為止了，光之巨人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:10:52,121 --> 00:10:56,084
<font color="white">從這星球的眾人心中消逝吧</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:11:19,315 --> 00:11:21,442
<font color="white">災難</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:11:21,526 --> 00:11:23,403
<font color="white">就此終結了</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:11:23,486 --> 00:11:24,404
<font color="white">怎麼可能？</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:11:24,487 --> 00:11:26,781
<font color="white">超人力霸王…</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:11:26,864 --> 00:11:28,866
<font color="white">被打倒了</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:29,951
<font color="white">活該</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:11:30,034 --> 00:11:31,160
<font color="white">真的是這樣嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:11:32,161 --> 00:11:33,496
<font color="white">他一動也不動</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:11:33,579 --> 00:11:36,833
<font color="white">那又怎樣？反正超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就是會帶來災難</font></font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:11:38,584 --> 00:11:40,044
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:11:53,641 --> 00:11:56,519
<font color="white">我贏不了他</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:58,729 --> 00:12:00,606
<font color="white">為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:03,151
<font color="white">我明明是光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:12:03,234 --> 00:12:05,611
<font color="white">他無法繼續戰鬥了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:12:05,695 --> 00:12:07,572
<font color="white">我有什麼辦法嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:12:07,655 --> 00:12:10,241
<font color="white">我怎麼可能打得贏積頓</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:12:10,324 --> 00:12:12,535
<font color="white">連爸都被那傢伙打倒了耶</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:12:14,370 --> 00:12:17,874
<font color="white">我害怕自己</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:12:17,957 --> 00:12:20,501
<font color="white">逐漸迷失自我</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:12:21,210 --> 00:12:23,588
<font color="white">我希望他能再奮戰</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:23,671 --> 00:12:26,757
<font color="white">你在胡說什麼？不可能</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:26,841 --> 00:12:30,470
<font color="white">不過要是我放棄了，誰能對抗他？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:33,514
<font color="white">誰都不可能贏過那傢伙的</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:33,598 --> 00:12:36,809
<font color="white">-沒那回事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-說得對</font></font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:39,020
<font color="white">你看看那個坑洞</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:44,025 --> 00:12:47,862
<font color="white">他已經不是以前</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那個嬌小的超人力霸王了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:50,156 --> 00:12:54,952
<font color="white">如果，你有與那傢伙一戰之力</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你會怎麼做？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:55,036 --> 00:12:57,580
<font color="white">這股力量…</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:57,663 --> 00:13:00,791
<font color="white">託付給我的這股力量…</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:13:00,875 --> 00:13:02,960
<font color="white">你們是地球的王牌</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:13:03,044 --> 00:13:06,506
<font color="white">就說了，他是真正的災難</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:10,718
<font color="white">即使如此，他仍試圖保護我們啊</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:13:10,801 --> 00:13:13,095
<font color="white">你是超人力霸王！對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:13:13,179 --> 00:13:15,014
<font color="white">會變成這樣都是他害的</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:13:15,097 --> 00:13:16,557
<font color="white">-你錯了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:19,936
<font color="white">-他才是真正的超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:20,019 --> 00:13:21,479
<font color="white">-他不曾找過藉口…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:21,562 --> 00:13:23,940
<font color="white">-孤身奮戰至今！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:24,023 --> 00:13:26,859
<font color="white">-學長…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:13:26,943 --> 00:13:29,946
<font color="white">真的是超人力霸王呢</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:30,029 --> 00:13:32,198
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:32,281 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">-拜託醒過來啊，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:44,085 --> 00:13:45,836
<font color="white">沒錯</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:14:02,103 --> 00:14:04,438
<font color="white">哇，這是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:14:04,981 --> 00:14:06,357
<font color="white">不會吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:19,412
<font color="white">超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:14:29,255 --> 00:14:30,965
<font color="white">上啊，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:14:31,048 --> 00:14:33,467
<font color="white">-加油啊！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:14:41,017 --> 00:14:43,603
<font color="white">看你那副模樣…</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:43,686 --> 00:14:48,941
<font color="white">不，看來你並非光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:50,985 --> 00:14:54,822
<font color="white">光之巨人也好，外星人也罷</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:54,906 --> 00:14:57,366
<font color="white">跟那些都無關</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:14:59,243 --> 00:15:02,914
<font color="white">我是超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:15:06,792 --> 00:15:10,963
<font color="white">這才稱得上是戰鬥的最高潮</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:15:59,804 --> 00:16:02,598
<font color="white">這股力量究竟是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:16:03,307 --> 00:16:04,225
<font color="white">（他真的是災難嗎？）</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:16:05,768 --> 00:16:07,436
<font color="white">上啊，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,189
<font color="white">太好了！幹得好，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:16:10,272 --> 00:16:12,775
<font color="white">你為什麼要幫那個</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">帶來災難的傢伙打氣？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:16:12,858 --> 00:16:15,403
<font color="white">只有一件事我可以肯定</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:16:15,486 --> 00:16:18,322
<font color="white">超人力霸王想保護我們</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:16:18,406 --> 00:16:21,951
<font color="white">我們不幫他加油，那還像話嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:35,172
<font color="white">沒想到超人力霸王的信仰</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已根深蒂固到這種地步</font></font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:16:35,965 --> 00:16:37,216
<font color="white">多麼可悲啊</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:16:38,926 --> 00:16:41,262
<font color="white">你的想法才是大錯特錯</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:16:41,345 --> 00:16:44,557
<font color="white">在這顆星球上，眾人的意志便是正義</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:47,935
<font color="white">我對此深信不疑</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:16:48,019 --> 00:16:51,355
<font color="white">那種東西可稱不上是正義</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:16:51,439 --> 00:16:56,986
<font color="white">至少在我所熟知的宇宙中並非如此</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:17:14,837 --> 00:17:16,839
<font color="white">對付他吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:17:16,922 --> 00:17:18,632
<font color="white">超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:17:22,386 --> 00:17:26,057
<font color="white">這不是裝甲的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:28,726
<font color="white">上啊，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:17:30,853 --> 00:17:31,937
<font color="white">進次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:17:43,407 --> 00:17:44,408
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:17:55,878 --> 00:17:57,088
<font color="white">各位！</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:17:59,715 --> 00:18:03,094
<font color="white">你還在磨蹭什麼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你是超人力霸王吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:18:03,677 --> 00:18:04,762
<font color="white">是的！</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:57,148 --> 00:19:01,485
<font color="white">每當你經過一次又一次的覺醒</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:19:02,153 --> 00:19:07,867
<font color="white">都會使更加偏頗的正義留在這地球上</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:11,162
<font color="white">那麼做是錯的</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:19:11,245 --> 00:19:14,081
<font color="white">或許是那樣沒錯，不過…</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:15,416 --> 00:19:17,585
<font color="white">正因為如此</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:19:17,668 --> 00:19:20,754
<font color="white">我必須不斷尋找應當前進的道路</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:19:20,838 --> 00:19:24,466
<font color="white">那就是我現在能得出的答案</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:19:25,176 --> 00:19:27,803
<font color="white">我會在另一個世界</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:19:28,637 --> 00:19:31,432
<font color="white">看著事情的始末</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,452
<font color="white">對了，你們兩個</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:19:51,535 --> 00:19:54,038
<font color="white">真的打算不做了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:19:54,121 --> 00:19:58,459
<font color="white">是啊，這次事件剛好是個不錯的契機</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:19:58,542 --> 00:20:01,921
<font color="white">科學特搜隊應該交給新的世代</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:20:02,004 --> 00:20:02,838
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:20:02,922 --> 00:20:04,173
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:20:04,256 --> 00:20:09,720
<font color="white">不過呢，就算退休了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你也要一直保持這樣的你喔</font></font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:20:09,803 --> 00:20:11,263
<font color="white">對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:20:11,347 --> 00:20:13,390
<font color="white">什麼？那句話是…</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:20:13,474 --> 00:20:14,391
<font color="white">這個嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:20:14,475 --> 00:20:17,061
<font color="white">真的非常抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:20:17,144 --> 00:20:19,104
<font color="white">請抬起頭來</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:20:19,688 --> 00:20:21,774
<font color="white">早田先生</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:20:21,857 --> 00:20:26,904
<font color="white">請你要一直保持這樣的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:20:28,113 --> 00:20:32,993
<font color="white">是過去的某人對我說過的重要話語</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:20:36,497 --> 00:20:40,960
<font color="white">沒想到我會被派遣到日本啊</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:20:41,043 --> 00:20:42,086
<font color="white">喂！</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:20:43,003 --> 00:20:46,090
<font color="white">我是太郎，我們已抵達現場上空</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:20:46,173 --> 00:20:47,883
<font color="white">少發牢騷了，傑克</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:20:47,967 --> 00:20:53,472
<font color="white">好啦，請你下命令囉，諸星老闆</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:20:53,555 --> 00:20:57,768
<font color="white">不，諸星新任隊長</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:21:01,272 --> 00:21:03,399
<font color="white">允許開始攻堅</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:21:04,441 --> 00:21:07,319
<font color="white">將那幫混帳外星人趕盡殺絕</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:21:07,987 --> 00:21:09,321
<font color="white">-遵命！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-遵命！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:21:11,073 --> 00:21:13,575
<font color="white">啊，我看過昨天的電視節目囉</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:21:13,659 --> 00:21:16,245
<font color="white">那名教授好像被妳精彩地駁倒了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:21:16,328 --> 00:21:19,123
<font color="white">我那樣還算有手下留情</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:21:19,206 --> 00:21:22,793
<font color="white">要是沒扎拉比的證詞可是會出大事的</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:21:22,876 --> 00:21:25,170
<font color="white">是嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:25,254 --> 00:21:27,631
<font color="white">妳還是老樣子耶</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:27,715 --> 00:21:28,716
<font color="white">話說回來</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,510
<font color="white">妳最近跟學長有聯繫嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:31,593 --> 00:21:34,805
<font color="white">有，他說現在過得很好</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:34,888 --> 00:21:36,140
<font color="white">是喔</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,350
<font color="white">-你看</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我瞧瞧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:40,644
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:41,645 --> 00:21:43,272
<font color="white">挺行的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:22:02,791 --> 00:22:04,460
<font color="white">遵命</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:22:07,463 --> 00:22:11,008
<font color="white">那麼，我要突襲了</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:24:03,954 --> 00:24:07,749
<font color="white">是喔，結果只剩你一人活下來啊</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:24:07,833 --> 00:24:09,877
<font color="white">這只能說我實力非凡吧</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,962
<font color="white">你出賣了自己的手足啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:24:12,045 --> 00:24:14,173
<font color="white">別講得那麼難聽</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:16,258
<font color="white">歡迎光臨</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:24:16,341 --> 00:24:17,593
<font color="white">啊，找到了</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:24:17,676 --> 00:24:20,137
<font color="white">天啊，妳還活著啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:24:20,220 --> 00:24:21,138
<font color="white">我還以為妳…</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:24:21,221 --> 00:24:25,142
<font color="white">真是遺憾啊，我可是很擅長裝死</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:24:27,978 --> 00:24:30,355
<font color="white">總之我們先乾杯吧</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:24:30,439 --> 00:24:31,773
<font color="white">乾杯</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:24:32,357 --> 00:24:35,819
<font color="white">哎呀，那邊不是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也有一個人跟我一樣嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:24:35,903 --> 00:24:39,406
<font color="white">是很擅長裝死的公主殿下</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:42,117
<font color="white">那幫大叔女僕呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:24:42,201 --> 00:24:44,494
<font color="white">少囉嗦，別煩我啦</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:24:44,578 --> 00:24:48,290
<font color="white">我說妳啊，在外頭見到面</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">別找我說話好嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:24:48,373 --> 00:24:49,875
<font color="white">我也是個好人</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:24:49,958 --> 00:24:51,168
<font color="white">你少在那邊胡說了</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:54,713
<font color="white">-老闆，再來一盤串燒</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-馬上來</font></font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:24:54,796 --> 00:24:59,635
<font color="white">哎呀，各位齊聚一堂啊</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:24:59,718 --> 00:25:01,094
<font color="white">-我要老樣子的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:25:01,178 --> 00:25:05,807
<font color="white">所以你們在此預謀</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">怎麼打倒超人力霸王嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:25:05,891 --> 00:25:08,060
<font color="white">在說什麼蠢話啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:25:08,143 --> 00:25:12,731
<font color="white">不只伊多、佩丹跟王牌殺手</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就連梅菲斯特都被打倒了耶</font></font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:25:12,814 --> 00:25:15,651
<font color="white">現在不流行抵抗他們好嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:25:15,734 --> 00:25:17,152
<font color="white">對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:25:17,236 --> 00:25:18,695
<font color="white">說得對啊</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:25:19,279 --> 00:25:20,781
<font color="white">那還真是可惜</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:25:20,864 --> 00:25:23,450
<font color="white">其實我打聽到一個有趣的消息</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:25:23,533 --> 00:25:25,661
<font color="white">是關於星團評議會</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:25:25,744 --> 00:25:28,372
<font color="white">喂，拜託別再給我們惹麻煩了</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:25:28,455 --> 00:25:31,208
<font color="white">說這什麼話？我可是非常歡迎</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:25:31,291 --> 00:25:33,752
<font color="white">你窩裡反後就自以為了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:25:33,835 --> 00:25:36,922
<font color="white">我可是還沒鬧夠！</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:25:37,005 --> 00:25:38,757
<font color="white">-吵死了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-總而言之！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:25:39,758 --> 00:25:41,510
<font color="white">我可不打算就這麼結束</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:25:41,593 --> 00:25:42,803
<font color="white">給我五瓶熱清酒</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:25:42,886 --> 00:25:44,221
<font color="white">-五瓶？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-馬上來</font></font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:25:45,222 --> 00:25:46,974
<font color="white">不會結束的</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:25:47,057 --> 00:25:49,518
<font color="white">-只要這顆星球…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那個人到底喝了幾攤啊？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:25:49,601 --> 00:25:51,979
<font color="white">-還存在著超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我看應該去過三間店了吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:25:52,062 --> 00:25:54,106
<font color="white">-是串燒</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不知道好不好吃</font></font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:27:30,327 --> 00:27:32,245
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：蔡柏頤</font><font color="white"></font>

